OL,3,GNEWSACall to help shape inquiry into
OL,4,ANHS trust failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe chair of a public inquiry into
OL,7,Fmental health care at an NHS trust has
OL,8,Fasked the public to help shape its
OL,9,Fterms of reference.
OL,11,FHis Honour Judge John Potter was
OL,12,Fappointed chair of a probe into serious
OL,13,Ffailings at Tees, Esk and Wear Valleys
OL,14,FNHS Foundation Trust (TEWV) earlier
OL,15,Fthis year.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,394,390,260,160,0,100
PN,39302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F393A1795021014
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kjs1 wsj#57sj  w{j#57i
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSACall to help shape inquiry into
OL,4,ANHS trust failings
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is proposed the inquiry would
OL,7,Fconsider deaths between January 2015
OL,8,Fand July 2025, while also looking at
OL,9,Fwhere people had died within three
OL,10,Fmonths of being discharged and
OL,11,Finstances of serious harm short of
OL,12,Fdeath.
OL,14,FPotter invited people to share their
OL,15,Fviews on the plans, saying he would
OL,16,Fconsider every response carefully and
OL,17,Fthat they would inform his
OL,18,Frecommendations of the terms of
OL,19,Freference to the government.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
